PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Long 19-turn game dominated by Opponent's Primitive Furnace/Single-Shot Rifle ping engine (destroyed own overcosted threats intentionally?) and repeated "exploding Pengullet" plays (Pengullet + explode skill, dealing self-damage to own board: 1000, then 2200, then 2500 dealt to Opponent's own Pals across turns 9/13/15 - a deliberate board-wipe/reset tech). Opponent's Elphidran (1900 power via stacked buffs) destroyed Trxvor's Lyleen Noct (turn 8). Opponent chip-attacked Trxvor with Chillet/Elphidran/Jormuntide/Cryolinx/Foxparks, several nullified by Trxvor's Blazehowl Noct/Cryolinx/Reindrix interrupts. Trxvor's Blazehowl Noct nullified attacks on turns 3, 4, and 16. By turn 18 Opponent still had 9 life but a wide, low-power board (mostly freshly-deployed Pengullets); Trxvor's own Pengullet chipped Opponent for 1 (10 to 9) on turn 19, after which Opponent surrendered despite the life lead (9 vs Trxvor's 4) - likely a resignation on board state / hand exhaustion rather than life total.


